#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:39
#: 4ef86350d22341f1a1ed4ecbfd14911a
msgid ""
"`./run.sh` shows the saved backend, then asks PhysX or Newton, CPU "
"governor, and which ROS 2 workspace to source. `./run_headless.sh` is the"
" same menu for Headless Streaming. Non-interactive examples from the "
"README:"
msgstr ""
"`./run.sh` 先显示已保存的后端，再询问 PhysX 或 Newton、CPU 调速，以及要 source 哪个 ROS 2 "
"工作空间。`./run_headless.sh` 是无头串流的同一套菜单。README 里的非交互例子："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:41
#: 3bf6db10115c4f229b4e5d7ee3b0f3ea
msgid ""
"./run.sh -y --physics physx --cpu auto --ros-ws ~/ros2_ws\n"
"./run_headless.sh -y --physics physx --instance 0\n"
"./run.sh --asset-region china\n"
"./run.sh --kit-profile none"
msgstr ""
"./run.sh -y --physics physx --cpu auto --ros-ws ~/ros2_ws\n"
"./run_headless.sh -y --physics physx --instance 0\n"
"./run.sh --asset-region china\n"
"./run.sh --kit-profile none"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:48
#: 790f5bcf437846629f2b1b2a58368e45
msgid ""
"`config/fa_sim.conf` kit profiles (`--kit-profile` / `--list-kit-"
"profiles`): `none`, `newton-physx-min`, `newton-physx`, `physx-compat`, "
"`physx-compat-full`. `--asset-region` is `none`, `us`, or `china`. Copy "
"`config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` to `config/fa_sim.local.conf` for a "
"machine override. When `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`, `./run.sh` "
"starts a Zenoh router and stops it on exit."
msgstr ""
"`config/fa_sim.conf` 的 kit 预设（`--kit-profile` / `--list-kit-"
"profiles`）：`none`、`newton-physx-min`、`newton-physx`、`physx-compat"
"`、`physx-compat-full`。`--asset-region` 为 `none`、`us` 或 `china`。把 "
"`config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` 复制成 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` "
"作为本机覆盖。当 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` 时，`./run.sh` 会启动 Zenoh "
"路由，并在退出时停掉它。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:50
#: 132ab8a971414d63b9aa3955fbcfd2b8
