#: 72af61bb61214f3a911e9fb7b71acc77
msgid "`joint_states_topic` = `/isaac/joint_states`"
msgstr "`joint_states_topic` = `/isaac/joint_states`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:70
#: bd4d8ca3041446c989c9c3a4824765b3
msgid ""
"`use_sim_time` follows `hardware` (`isaac` → true) unless you pass "
"`use_sim_time:=true` or `false`."
