#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:3
#: eec398ec68b34345a1c27c79c9049a9b
msgid ""
"Open a robot in NVIDIA Isaac Sim and drive it with the same ROS 2 stack "
"you use on the real machine."
msgstr "在 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 里打开一台机器人，用和真机同一套 ROS 2 运控把它驱动起来。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:5
#: 38e6265491964a8998963e0b0ea9261c
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac holds the assets. Run `./init.sh`, then `./run.sh` or "
"`./run_headless.sh`. You choose the robot by opening its USD. There is no"
" `./run.sh --robot`. The Isaac path and version are in "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`, with a machine override in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 放的是资产。先 `./init.sh`，再 `./run.sh` 或 `./run_headless.sh`。打开哪份 "
"USD，就是选哪台机器人。没有 `./run.sh --robot`。Isaac 的路径和版本在 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，单机覆盖写在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:7
#: 1ca72c8d18ec4975b1dba5eb1dd78f7d
msgid "Connect ROS 2 in one of two ways. Use one of them for a given stage."
msgstr "ROS 2 有两种接法。一个舞台用其中一种。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: c2192d3e070b4957a43f2c29673a9c1b
msgid "What you start"
msgstr "你启动的是什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: 7181f54367e344a4a7180b0d4b8b0e06
msgid "Play on an in-process `ROS2ControlLaunch`"
msgstr "在进程内的 `ROS2ControlLaunch` 上按 Play"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md
#: e87ba36b4f6040dc8778d365f18bf1d2
msgid "The controller manager inside the Isaac process"
msgstr "Isaac 进程里的控制器管理器"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:14
#: dd4bcafb7ac345edb24b38cc2101e4d9
msgid ""
"`isaac_sim` is the hardware interface for that in-process controller. It "
"is not a second robot. Clock, TF, and the rest of the mechanism: [FaSim-"
"Isaac reference](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)."
msgstr ""
"`isaac_sim` 是这套进程内控制器的驱动层，不是第二台机器人。时钟、TF 和其余机制见 [FaSim-Isaac "
"参考](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:16
#: 7c0e9a611c4e434d9c9b14310b70b02c
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:18
#: 960288be4553446e89776e2ffa78f5d6
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim is installed, the GPU driver matches it, and `ISAACSIM_DIR` "
"points at that install (`~/isaacsim` unless you set another path)."
msgstr "Isaac Sim 已安装，显卡驱动与之匹配，`ISAACSIM_DIR` 指向这次安装（除非你另设路径，否则是 `~/isaacsim`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:19
#: 6d0a1399cc7b4f919052d6bea3930496
msgid ""
"A ROS 2 Jazzy workspace already builds this robot: `open-deploy-ws`, or "
"[fa-deploy-ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws) once you can"
" open that repository."
msgstr ""
"一个已经能编译这台机器人的 ROS 2 Jazzy 工作区：`open-deploy-ws`，或者你能打开的 [fa-deploy-"
"ws](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-deploy-ws)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:20
#: f89d94db728c41eeab649686e97d658c
msgid ""
"The topic bridge needs `topic_based_ros2_control` in that workspace. The "
"in-process graph needs `./init.sh` operation 5, which installs "
"`fasim.ros2.nodes` into this Isaac, and a description xacro that accepts "
"`hardware` `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"话题桥需要工作区里有 `topic_based_ros2_control`。进程内的图需要 `./init.sh` 的第 5 项，它会把 "
"`fasim.ros2.nodes` 装进这次 Isaac，并且描述 xacro 要接受 `hardware` 取值 `isaac_sim`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:31
#: f981f214b9a74e37907d0be1c9abd32f
msgid ""
"`./init.sh` asks you to ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)):"
msgstr ""
"`./init.sh` 会请你做这些事（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/README.md)）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:33
#: 201ad5c9213e4636b1e93526b4bbf368
msgid ""
"Check out the submodules you select (`.gitmodules` and "
"`submodules_visibility.conf`). Public entries start checked. Private "
"entries, including [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-"
"project-usd), stay unchecked until you can open them. A later run only "
"adds what you check."
msgstr ""
"检出你勾选的子模块（`.gitmodules` 和 `submodules_visibility.conf`）。公开项默认勾上。私有项，包括 "
"[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd)，在你能打开之前保持不勾。以后再跑只会补上新勾的项。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:34
#: fdac0c8d24544704ac390b495b0e9eb2
msgid ""
"Update submodules you already checked out (`./init.sh --update`). This "
"does not pull the FaSim repository itself."
msgstr "更新已经检出的子模块（`./init.sh --update`）。这一步不会拉取 FaSim 仓库本身。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:36
#: 79f7d4e9a4c04531ba259ac55d855534
msgid ""
"Optionally add an Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay under `isaac_jazzy_ws/`. The "
"menu asks GitHub for stable tags. If that query fails, "
"`config/fa_sim.conf` falls back to `6.2.0`, `6.1.0`, and `6.0.1`. "
"Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`."
msgstr ""
"可以在 `isaac_jazzy_ws/` 下加一层 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 叠加。菜单会向 GitHub "
"查询稳定标签。查询失败时，`config/fa_sim.conf` 回退到 `6.2.0`、`6.1.0` 和 `6.0.1`。用 "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:37
#: 678d48302cfd4e009843f629a092bc42
msgid ""
"Install the FaSim extensions into this Isaac "
"(`exts/fasim.steering.nodes`, `exts/fasim.ros2.nodes`) and quiet the "
"script warnings. Run this again after you reinstall Isaac, then restart "
"Isaac so the extensions load."
msgstr ""
"把 FaSim 扩展装进这次 "
"Isaac（`exts/fasim.steering.nodes`、`exts/fasim.ros2.nodes`），并压低脚本警告。重装 "
"Isaac 之后再做一次，然后重启 Isaac，扩展才会加载。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:63
#: 6151d105f627487a82302991b1402293
msgid ""
"The shared macro [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" sets:"
msgstr ""
"共享宏 [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" 写成："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:68
#: 380774563cb04f3ea8563061e44124c7
msgid ""
"Those strings have to match the OmniGraph `topicName` on this robot. W2’s"
" topic-bridge payload [`W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda) publishes `/joint_command` and "
"`/joint_states` instead. If the two sides differ, change the xacro "
"`<param>` or the graph until `ros2 topic echo` shows the same "
"`sensor_msgs/JointState` names the controller is using. Plugin "
"parameters: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)."
msgstr ""
"这些字符串必须和这台机器人上 OmniGraph 的 `topicName` 一致。W2 的话题桥载荷 "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-"
"gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda) 发布的是 "
"`/joint_command` 和 `/joint_states`。两边不一致时，改 xacro 的 `<param>` 或改图，直到 "
"`ros2 topic echo` 看到的 `sensor_msgs/JointState` 名字和控制器正在用的一致。插件参数见 "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:81
#: f20f7bc97ff440e09a350089d7740c63
msgid "In-process hardware interface (`isaac_sim`)"
msgstr "进程内驱动层（`isaac_sim`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:83
#: b049d9a09e244815a1be9bbc20122fd8
msgid ""
"Use this when the USD contains `fasim.ros2.nodes.ROS2ControlLaunch`. W2’s"
" in-process payload is "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda). Press"
" Play. The node calls `emit_control`, which sets `hardware=isaac_sim`, "
"passes the ArticulationRoot as `isaac_prim_path`, and starts the "
"controller manager inside Isaac."
msgstr ""
"USD 里有 `fasim.ros2.nodes.ROS2ControlLaunch` 时用这条。W2 的进程内载荷是 "
"[`W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)。按 "
"Play。节点调用 `emit_control`，设置 `hardware=isaac_sim`，把 ArticulationRoot 传成 "
"`isaac_prim_path`，并在 Isaac 里启动控制器管理器。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:85
#: b35c19dc5ca74eeca2e63b16dc62fd1b
msgid ""
"The description package still has to exist. Its ros2_control xacro "
"includes `simulation_hardware_plugin` for `isaac_sim` "
"([robot_common_launch README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)). The graph "
"inputs are `robot`, `mode` (`demo`, `split_body`, `full_body`), `type`, "
"and the optional `namespace`, `infoFile`, and `arms`. An empty `robot` "
"reads the USD `Robot` variant. That string is the description package "
"stem."
msgstr ""
"描述包仍然要有。它的 ros2_control xacro 要为 `isaac_sim` 包含 "
"`simulation_hardware_plugin`（[robot_common_launch "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md)）。图的输入是 "
"`robot`、`mode`（`demo`、`split_body`、`full_body`）、`type`，以及可选的 "
"`namespace`、`infoFile`、`arms`。`robot` 为空时读取 USD 的 `Robot` "
"变体，这个字符串就是描述包名去掉 `_description` 之前的那一段。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:87
#: 1dc5843e037a43ee81473e5c64544453
msgid "After Play, check:"
msgstr "Play 之后检查："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:99
#: ff552b3cb6424fceb507f7f7d988ef71
msgid ""
"Whole-body mode (`mode` `full_body`) loads `ocs2_wbc_controller`. That "
"package is already in the GitHub Release deb `ros-jazzy-arms-"
"ros2-control`. Choose `d` for arms in `./init_repo.sh`, or run "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`. Cloning [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) is how "
"you read or edit the source. To hold a mobile base, keep the "
"description’s `mobile_base_tcp` info and send `BASE_LOCK`. A `full_body` "
"graph whose `infoFile` points at a `fixed_base` info file has no virtual "
"chassis joint for that lock, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`."
msgstr ""
"全身模式（`mode` 为 `full_body`）会加载 `ocs2_wbc_controller`。这个包已经在 GitHub Release"
" 的 deb `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 里。`./init_repo.sh` 给 arms 选 `d`，或运行 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`。克隆 [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) "
"是为了读源码或改源码。要按住移动底盘，保留描述里的 `mobile_base_tcp` info，并发送 "
"`BASE_LOCK`。`full_body` 的图把 `infoFile` 指到一份 `fixed_base` info "
"时，没有这把锁能用的虚拟底盘关节，手臂使能会停在 `WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:116
#: d6a3afc4b83a4bfc8024e00dcc21ce27
msgid ""
"**Play starts, but no ROS 2 topics appear.** The domain id and "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION` match the workspace you sourced. For the topic "
"bridge, the graph `topicName` matches the xacro. For the in-process "
"graph, operation 5 is installed and Isaac was restarted, and the stage’s "
"`ROS` variant is the fiveages payload rather than the topic-bridge "
"payload."
msgstr ""
"**Play 起来了，但没有 ROS 2 话题。** 域 ID 和 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION` 要和你 source "
"的工作区一致。话题桥：图的 `topicName` 和 xacro 一致。进程内：第 5 项已安装，Isaac 已重启，场景里的 `ROS` 变体是"
" fiveages 载荷，而不是话题桥载荷。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md:118
#: 6bfd06c9d34d49d3a5239c07c5abbce7
msgid ""
"**A motion finishes much too fast.** On the in-process payload, `/clock` "
"comes from the on-demand `ROS_Clock` graph (`OnPhysicsStep`). That is how"
" W2 `fiveages.usda` is already wired. The topic-bridge `ros2.usda` still "
"publishes the clock from `OnPlaybackTick`. Fix the clock before you edit "
"joint gains. The mechanism is on the [FaSim-Isaac "
"reference](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)."
msgstr ""
"**动作结束得特别快。** 进程内载荷上，`/clock` 来自按物理步更新的 `ROS_Clock` 图（`OnPhysicsStep`）。W2 的 "
"`fiveages.usda` 已经是这样接的。话题桥的 `ros2.usda` 仍从 `OnPlaybackTick` "
"发布时钟。先改时钟，再考虑关节增益。机制见 [FaSim-Isaac "
"参考](../../4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md)。"

